Notation facts from the OMG BPMN 2.0.2 specification (formal/13-12-09). Style principles distilled from: Bruce Silver's Method and Style rules as published on the author's site (methodandstyle.com); the Real-Life BPMN authors' published modelling practice (Camunda best-practice guides); eCH-0158 BPMN modelling conventions v1.2 (Verein eCH, 2020); Mendling, Reijers and van der Aalst, Seven Process Modeling Guidelines (2010); Mendling, Reijers and Recker, Activity labeling in process modeling (2010); D. L. Moody's analysis of the BPMN 2.0 visual notation; zur Muehlen and Recker, How much language is enough? (2008). Paraphrased; no source text reproduced.
